<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was very slow in the panhandle area late Tuesday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested at the closed.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. 14,700 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 13,000 formulated and 1,400 previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Heifers - select, few choice 2-3 1000-1100 lbs 71.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:     300     Week Ago:  1,900     Year Ago: 57,500</p>
<p>Wk to date: 14,700     Week Ago: 32,800     Year Ago: 79,200</p>
</text>
